{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433970/extras/e107ff0cbf217439043265b57327ccbb.avif?t=1737552677\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready to experience football like never before with VR Head Football!</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off your skills, test your reflexes, and enjoy the thrill of this unique experience. In the game, make accurate headers to hit targets and achieve the highest scores. Step into a world of fun and competition to sharpen your football skills.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433970/extras/327bbe802b517354cb32cb8f0d94446c.avif?t=1737552677\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433970/extras_big/327bbe802b517354cb32cb8f0d94446c.avif?t=1737552677 width=800 height=286 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple: Time your headers perfectly and strike at the right angle to hit the targets and earn points. But don\u2019t be fooled\u2014it\u2019s more challenging than it sounds! Quick reflexes and precise timing are the keys to success in the game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level introduces new challenges, constantly pushing you to improve. Faster balls, tougher targets, and unexpected surprises will keep you on your toes as you progress.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every header, earn higher scores and climb your way to the top. Compete to secure your place on the leaderboard and prove just how good your football skills really are.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/